{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33295","headline":"古宴曲 · 于濆","name":"古宴曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雉扇合蓬莱，朝车回紫陌。\n重门集嘶马，言宴金张宅。\n燕娥奉巵酒，低鬟若无力。\n十户手胼胝，凤凰钗一只。\n高楼齐下视，日照罗衣色。\n笑指负薪人，不信生中国。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33295.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33295","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}